            "value": "Kranner, B. P., Afrooz, A. R. M. N., Fitzgerald, N. J. M., & Boehm, A. B. (2019). Fecal indicator bacteria and virus removal in stormwater biofilters: Effects of biochar, media saturation, and field conditioning. Plos One, 14(9), e0222719. http://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0222719",
